    "We do not use advertising cookies, tracking pixels, or analytics cookies. No third-party tracking scripts are loaded on the app.": "Wir verwenden keine Werbe-Cookies, Tracking-Pixel oder Analyse-Cookies. In der App werden keine Tracking-Skripte von Drittanbietern geladen.",
    "Data Retention": "Speicherdauer",
    "Your data is retained for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account:": "Deine Daten werden gespeichert, solange dein Konto aktiv ist. Wenn du dein Konto löschst:",
